  ("What is the quietest kind of furnace for an Oakville home?", "A two-stage, variable-speed furnace is the quietest common choice. Models like the Lennox EL297V at 97% AFUE run on low stage most of the time, so they are quieter and keep temperatures steadier than a single-stage furnace."),
